<title>LATVIA: AIR BALTIC STARTS CARGO DEPARTMENT.</title>
<headline>AIR BALTIC STARTS CARGO DEPARTMENT.</headline>
<dateline>RIGA 1997-04-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Airline Air Baltic on Thursday said it has launched a cargo department that will look after the servicing of cargo between Latvia, Scandinavia and Finland and carry out general cargo services for Scandinavian Airlines.</p>
<p>The new department will be led at the beginning by a SAS representative, Air Baltic said in a statement.</p>
<p>-- Riga Newsroom, +371 721 5240</p>
